<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts GATX Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts GATX Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Donald Zwyer initiated coverage of GATX Corp with a strong buy rating, calling the stock a &quot;solid long-term investment.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The shares were down 1-1/8 to 48-1/2.</p>
</text>
